<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Fishermen's Associations Act 1971 [Act 44], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in the national language text, by substituting for the words \"syarikat kerjasama\" wherever appearing the word \"koperasi\". Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@> .
