<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended in section 2, in the definition of \"Area Fishermen's Association\", by deleting the words \"and includes a fishermen's co-operative society\". Amendment of section 11"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/36/eng@> .
